{"page":114,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:37","surah":5,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"يُرِيدُونَ أَن يَخْرُجُوا۟ مِنَ ٱلنَّارِ وَمَا هُم بِخَـٰرِجِينَ مِنْهَا ۖ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مُّقِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will wish to come out of the Fire but they will be unable to do so: theirs will be a lasting torment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُرِيدُونَ","en_gloss":"They will wish","transliteration":"yurīdūna","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَخْرُجُوا۟","en_gloss":"they come out","transliteration":"yakhrujū","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","en_gloss":"the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"but not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُم","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِخَـٰرِجِينَ","en_gloss":"will come out","transliteration":"bikhārijīna","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنْهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"And for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُّقِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"lasting","transliteration":"muqīmun","verse_key":"5:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:37"}]},{"verse_key":"5:38","surah":5,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلسَّارِقُ وَٱلسَّارِقَةُ فَٱقْطَعُوٓا۟ أَيْدِيَهُمَا جَزَآءًۢ بِمَا كَسَبَا نَكَـٰلًا مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Cut off the hands of thieves, whether they are man or woman, as punishment for what they have done- a deterrent from God: God is almighty and wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلسَّارِقُ","en_gloss":"And (for) the male thief","transliteration